Package: deb-manager-gui
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         apt,
         python3,
         python3-pyqt6
Recommends: pkexec,
            sudo
Description: graphical progress window for APT package operations
 deb-manager-gui installs or removes APT packages and local .deb files
 while showing a Qt 6 progress window, followed by a success or error
 message. It is meant to be started by other programs, usually through
 pkexec, with the package list on the command line:
 .
   deb-manager-gui --in|--rm|--deb <package...> [--tx <message>]
 .
 The interface follows the language of the KDE Plasma session, also when
 started through pkexec.
